# Symlink to the harness's LADDER.md, created per-checkout by the harness
# itself. Not work this repo produced, so it must not count as untracked work:
# scripts/resume-clean.sh otherwise reports every clean checkout as an
# interrupted run, and its `git clean -fd` deletes the link on every --apply.
/LADDER.md
